  The almost completely unknown '^' command.

  From the Guidebook <http://www.nethack.org/v343/Guidebook.html>

'^' - Ask for the type of a trap you found earlier.

  Stand next to the item.  Press '^'.  Use the direction of the item.
If the previously identified portal is there it says:

  "That is a magic portal."

  That's works, but it's a bit tricky.  I've found that 3-4 cursed
scrolls of gold detection work great for zeroing in on portals,
especially on the Plane of Water.

  Do a confused non-cursed scroll of gold detection first, after you're
half way across.  (Levitation is important.)

  


